THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The voice clips in sounds/ are dialogue from the video game POSTAL 2.

  POSTAL 2 (c) Running With Scissors, Inc.
  Postal Dude voiced by Rick Hunter.

All rights to those recordings remain with their respective owners. They
are redistributed here in short excerpts, at reduced quality, for
non-commercial community use, as a transformative repurposing unrelated
to the game's own market. No affiliation with or endorsement by Running
With Scissors is claimed or implied.

If you are a rights holder and object to this distribution, open an issue
on the source repository and the pack will be removed.

Do not use this pack commercially.
